  "keyFeatures": [
    "Compile Metaflow flows to Dagster jobs",
    "Support for all graph shapes (linear, branching, foreach, conditional)",
    "Automatic parameter forwarding as Dagster Config",
    "Built-in retry and timeout handling",
    "Event-driven sensors and scheduling",
    "Resume failed runs with original run ID",
    "Resource hints for compute backends",
    "Step decorator injection at deploy time"
